<title>FRANCE: Cheuvreux puts out buy advice on Labinal.</title>
<headline>Cheuvreux puts out buy advice on Labinal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>French brokers Cheuvreux de Virieu changed its recommendation on Labinal to two (buy) from three (sell), fund managers said.</p>
<p>The broker, which does not comment on its recommendations, was reported to have changed its earnings forecast to 42 francs per share for 1996, from 37 francs, and 73 francs instead of 69 for 1997.</p>
<p>Labinal was up 6.07 percent at 891 francs at 1430 GMT.</p>
